{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "999736779a77d5d9037d24b4eaf1b2d7c92fb07aa023364ee25eb97f985351ce", "ja": "ドンツクドンツク☆大冒険", "zh": "咚咚咚☆大冒险", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "107e0674b7ffaff897372bcd32dd29c8491f77fabaed8deaf3130c02fc50bd50", "ja": "よくわからないけど楽しそうだと、ジャング\nル探検を始める探検隊。歩と出会い、ここに\nは何でも願いが叶うお宝があると教えてもら\nう。お宝を巡ってダンス勝負をする環と歩。\n真美が変顔で歩を笑わせ、環が勝利した。", "zh": "虽然搞不清楚状况，不过感觉很有趣，探险队\n就这样开始丛林探险。一行人遇见了步，\n她告诉众人这里有能够实现任何愿望的宝物。\n为了争夺宝物，环跟步以舞蹈决胜负，\n最后是真美扮鬼脸逗笑了步，由环取得胜利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a89e81f9ffe0d71a36482f680fca4b1c84a859875341d6ed83ada6447389007a", "ja": "（真美と環と共に劇場の倉庫の扉を開けると、\nそこはジャングルだった）", "zh": "（跟真美还有环一起打开了剧场的仓库门，\n眼前竟是一片丛林。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "73147c9efe9f7ae45e1b13684dfcfff030e5ae81a07737d620e77dc08b4a7e39", "ja": "って、どういうことだ！？\nどうして倉庫がジャングルに？", "zh": "呃，这是怎么一回事！？\n为什么仓库会变成丛林？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "deeee1c2a6d8c097c4dabe81f3eec035bfd5be62cc49194a171c3e628372f057", "ja": "わかんないけど、メッチャ楽しいことになってんね！\n探検家・真美のウデが、ぎゅんぎゅん鳴ってるよ～！", "zh": "虽然不知道怎么回事，但事情变得很有趣耶！\n探险家真美忍不住想大展身手～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "bc805af1a47a492b4386bb0cdac339ee05f7f6d312cb20dd17c5f750870e1624", "ja": "すごいね、おやぶん！\nたまき、ジャングルの探検なんてはじめてだぞっ！", "zh": "好厉害耶，老大！\n环这还是第一次进丛林探险喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4a4aa9c845b0e77615cc68dbe58c3b102db6f681787d73dd6f252dc77bef3570", "ja": "まあ、そうだろうな……。", "zh": "嗯，我想也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "e67932b11ddfa6a6b0f443b417d8fbb9e7b5aa8948dc9688bc893dbedaa41f7a", "ja": "くふふ♪　ゴリラとかに会えるかな～？\nはやく行こ、まみ！", "zh": "呵呵♪会不会见到大猩猩之类的呢～？\n赶快出发吧，真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "484df61278063f83fc0718c2a57b67443764b223a0ee6206c5484b2c1c50e899", "ja": "うん！　まみたま探検隊、レッツゴー！", "zh": "嗯！真美阿环探险队，Let's Go！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b799900631da7f91e647f61eb6c923f3ca56d0f50cb84d55e365623dc3095879", "ja": "あ、おい！　待つんだ！\n……くっ、二人を追いかけよう！", "zh": "喂、喂！等一下！\n……啧，我得追上她们两个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "545c0e4068f2ac257ba8a3c2372c485df927dd9e7962c3de277d0f5ae848725b", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nやっと追いついた。", "zh": "呼……呼……\n终于追上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "ad23a55ed04d18d790d224e3b1c8c64994da1e0e9c0f32ea64663cb4b6a71817", "ja": "あっ、おやぶん！\n見て見て、たまき、こんなの捕まえたぞ！", "zh": "啊，老大！\n你看你看，环抓到这个了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1010_hebi", "source_sha256": "185520ee235b6a92794bbdc4048ed47dd7a14f195a9975033aa08855e9c33247", "ja": "シャー！", "zh": "嘶──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1fa62ffda5516551a28107477ca68ea1106fe6d80900515558ed8944f09cd44c", "ja": "うおっ、ヘビじゃないか！？\n早く逃がすんだ！", "zh": "唔噢，这不是蛇吗！？\n赶快放开牠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1012_040tam", "source_sha256": "f50677d7ea9fdcacc6182ea477bdccec39510c5992522382c0dde25a25a2ca66", "ja": "はーい。\nまた遊ぼうね、ヘビ美！", "zh": "好的──\n下次再一起玩吧，蛇美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "193efdbfc3e6c4bdac1c893024b99f84cb3f0757fffd1aaaa0ec8c3dde050474", "ja": "兄ちゃん、兄ちゃん！　向こうにゾウがいるよ！\n捕まえて、劇場で飼ってもいい！？", "zh": "大哥哥、大哥哥！前面有大象耶！\n可以抓起来养在剧场里吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "9803d5ec02a5d33400e1e21cf9b0934b43b467d2fc629e12ec9dc8edf8969cfd", "ja": "ダメだ！\nゾウを飼う余裕なんて、劇場にはないぞ！", "zh": "不行！\n剧场可养不了大象！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "dd14b9794863f16b54917f914c00074c80436132f6121d41795f63fbaab2aed5", "ja": "えー！　あんなに広いのに！？", "zh": "咦～！明明那么宽敞的说！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "da159a0befa9275ae74a930817c7983e0c231861205e22d57d5ce9aab59563bc", "ja": "そうか、天井も高いし……\nいや、そういう意味じゃない！　ダメだ！", "zh": "对耶，天花板也很高……\n不，不是空间的问题！不行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4340acffe3440d8e62d0e6ff71531d579f15251f1076951477e0d9b3177e4ef9", "ja": "そんなことより、いったん劇場に帰るぞ、二人とも。\nここは何が起こるかわからない。危険すぎる。", "zh": "先不要管大象，两位，我们要先回剧场了。\n待在这里不知道会遇到什么事，太危险了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "3683bc4e0c31e2983439673fb14006e13c46adbe7ba7c3c903eeeff70b698ae7", "ja": "え～！？　兄ちゃんは、なんで倉庫が\nジャングルになったか気になんないの！？", "zh": "咦～！？难道大哥哥不好奇\n为什么仓库会变成丛林吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "90e4b6f9aacb8495b7f36b53bfa5d2b663016b56ffb0e9ff7c7305400e6978be", "ja": "もちろん気になるけど、それは今すぐ\n調べなくていい。とりあえず、帰るんだ！", "zh": "当然好奇，不过这件事不急着现在调查。\n总之回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "0c16ce6c8084e1e688c797cf4b57302ad40d492e8353e5323ead069e75f3fc40", "ja": "あれ？　でも兄ちゃん、やっぱ真美たち……\nスグには帰れないっぽいよ？", "zh": "咦？不过大哥哥，看来真美我们……\n好像没办法马上回去了耶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "d377b67a1e36b2e364b6ccb670a79b44dd087de52e97a3d09049d9cfccabe5a9", "ja": "おやぶん、たまきたち、\nどこから入ってきたの？", "zh": "老大，\n环我们是从哪里进来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1022_p", "source_sha256": "56a81cfb52bfe99cd6cf22bfb98cfbce3de822e1366973a5f0c0e9c531c239be", "ja": "え？　俺の、まっすぐ後ろの扉に決まって……\nって、扉が見えない！　消えてるじゃないか！？", "zh": "什么？当然是我背后的这扇门……\n呃，没看到门！它消失了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "1e8e25ca4209e0fa24c539b42356cae2ed1d5a545c15ef730deccdeb98b8a93b", "ja": "んっふっふ～。これはもう、真美たちの力で\nジャングルのヒミツを解くしかありませんな！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～这下子只能靠真美我们的力量\n来解开丛林的秘密了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "293ad71c4d424dff4801a4ede8cfd91965ba66a0950016796a1aa923bd54914a", "ja": "うん、たまき、ヒミツをとくぞ！\nねっ、いこうよ、おやぶんっ！", "zh": "嗯，环会解开秘密的！\n好嘛，走吧，老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "78e638681ee710949562b5690f4b93d2b7a94483fdaab562ab0bf3bfced5de17", "ja": "……くっ、仕方ない。どうあれ、\nジャングルを探検するしかなさそうだな。", "zh": "……啧，好吧。\n看来也只有到丛林里探险这个选择了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太棒了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1027_040tam", "source_sha256": "86e0ad77d85b1e34871fb22d4f711f0e53727460a43f34bdcb0e80d7312a8075", "ja": "やったー！", "zh": "太好了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1028_p", "source_sha256": "48ad1ce1bbe7fb28311fa8dcc3641c65796da8fd9111c4649b21317d8eb42eec", "ja": "ただし、二人とも俺から絶対に離れないこと！\nいいな？", "zh": "不过，你们两个绝对不能离开我身边！\n知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1029_040tam", "source_sha256": "a861379e01efb204ebcdade4e735319bfb0aebf74ca140c40ed324e65055be3f", "ja": "うんっ！　ありがと、おやぶんっ！\nくふふっ、まみたまおやぶん探検隊、行くぞ～！", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，老大！\n呵呵，真美阿环老大探险队，出发啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e5128cc80ce18ce0c519739d13fe913eb50b737e4258f9cac33957eef14eb7f4", "ja": "（俺達はしばらく、ジャングルを歩いた。この暑さ、\nこの広さ……。どうやら本物のジャングルのようだ）", "zh": "（我们在丛林中走了一会。\n从这里的气温跟大小来看……似乎是真正的丛林。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "63cb8bb98861c7e93818b9d4e57fb1246dec1d00ed994a5ed8c57537422376f3", "ja": "（以前は確かに、ただの倉庫だったはずだが。\n扉を間違えたとか、そういう問題じゃないし……）", "zh": "（不过这里以前的确只是一般的仓库。\n况且也不是进错门这种问题……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1032_040tam", "source_sha256": "ea3bead95bdd880fd156f790391a7ee112fe76460c1e327c491427acdce705a9", "ja": "あっ、あそこに誰かいるぞ！", "zh": "啊，那里好像有人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1033_p", "source_sha256": "76f4fb11c9186df11d651302776316286ce0c77caef196dc0522c43b2c59ddc5", "ja": "えっ、人が？　……いや、ここはジャングルだし、\n何者かもわからない。ここは様子を……。", "zh": "咦，有人吗？不，这里可是丛林，\n也不知道对方是什么人。暂时先观察一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1034_012mam", "source_sha256": "f6ba803a9c977f8b072ec0108c90d1bcc2e79848271d64f706f81c9bb0bc3722", "ja": "おーい、第一村人のひとー！　やっぴょーん！", "zh": "喂──那边的一号村民！呀蹦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1035_p", "source_sha256": "51ed2b02b3660a47419efebe5ed3221cfeb7a5db032f211b756b9c73b0a9f88e", "ja": "うわあっ、危険すぎる！\nどこか隠れるところは……！？", "zh": "唔哇！也太危险了！\n有没有哪里可以藏身……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "019bc4771fa2a531229c01c3c62e8e0f6c44d51567c8c27cc9b6192adba28419", "ja": "あれっ、真美と環じゃん。\nん？　それに、{$P$}も？", "zh": "咦，这不是真美跟环吗？\n嗯？还有{$P$}也在？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "0689d1556a69c029788562a2b3dbecd752d39054248b28807646207cbb55b997", "ja": "って、歩！？\nな、なんで歩が、ジャングルに……？", "zh": "咦，步！？\n为、为什么步会在丛林里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1038_012mam", "source_sha256": "cd00c6ab9c76b4f2caebca3cf58602af3516d143537ab41727c839b6a0d97b07", "ja": "なんだ、あゆあゆかー。あゆあゆは面白いけど、\nいつでも会えるからガッカリだよ～。", "zh": "什么嘛，原来是步步～虽然步步也很有趣，\n但本来就能随时见到，好失望喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1039_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3c5088974c7f17d82a8973d5f5aa91376cad8706a5239638c1dd65f1ecf6ff91", "ja": "ガッカリってなんだ！？　……けど、そうか。真美達が\nここにいるってことは、アレを探しに来たんだな？", "zh": "为什么失望啊！？不过，我懂了。\n真美你们是为了找那个才到这里来的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1040_p", "source_sha256": "a504459101f8c5b8bee99cb24d9b77b095cacb6761a43f0167492bf1c253543b", "ja": "アレ？　……何のことだ、歩。", "zh": "那个……？步，你是指什么东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "374ee579a6c4d0ba5178db276a739c8335e116080afdd25f7220b3c2a310d1af", "ja": "知らないの？　このジャングルに眠るお宝を\n手に入れると、願いが何でも叶うってウワサ。", "zh": "你不知道吗？有个传闻说，只要得到\n沉睡在这座丛林中的宝物，就能够实现任何愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1042_012mam", "source_sha256": "adfe33a77da32b518d9d42eb1550b567e854f374e18b63df501af57204b9eec4", "ja": "えっ、このジャングル、そんなお宝があるの？\nメッチャ冒険っぽくなってきたね、たまきち！", "zh": "咦，这座丛林里有那种宝物吗？\n超级有冒险的感觉啦，阿环！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1043_040tam", "source_sha256": "275a87532ddd66ca7c6168afbaf200af4f9b229a9a136a17b27ec3a85f049573", "ja": "うん！　たまき、おたから手に入れたら、\n誰も見たことない虫がほしいぞ！", "zh": "嗯！环要是得到宝物，\n愿望就是得到任何人都没看过的昆虫喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1044_012mam", "source_sha256": "509039ddc9667a8f57c9fddfe7c0c7af5ad6739c13a00e825979dd3e41581e28", "ja": "真美はねー。どんなイタズラしても、\n律っちゃんに怒られないで、甘やかされたい！", "zh": "真美啊～希望无论做什么恶作剧，\n小律都不生气，还会宠爱真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1045_p", "source_sha256": "8c3aa9b8e77d2d6c9a149b925519ac783c5554a987fbf7dc696a3ddd787e826f", "ja": "二人とも、それでいいのか……？　まあ、そもそも\n願いが叶うお宝なんて、にわかには信じがたいけど。", "zh": "你们两个许这种愿望就好吗……？算了，重点是，\n说有能够实现愿望的宝物，一时半刻实在无法相信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "b735b0b02f01c53fe35de5e30e0dedae73fbd9bbaadb847ff476d248aca41051", "ja": "でも、劇場がジャングルになってしまうくらいだし。\nそのウワサも、本当かもしれないな……。", "zh": "不过，毕竟现在连剧场都变成丛林了。\n这个传闻也有可能是真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0d72fc8083f9d14a27b2ac33dabf65bdecca2d157b0dd0ea0e6bbcea3a678b22", "ja": "アタシは、必ずそのお宝を手に入れるんだ。\n絶対に叶えたい願いがあるからな。", "zh": "我绝对会得到那个宝物的。\n因为我有一个必须实现的愿望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "93061d6c2719cf8c5fd5a39180cf1a79142a14fa2e0195dd0e043efc75d5caef", "ja": "あゆむの願いごとって、なんなの？", "zh": "步的愿望是什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1049_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e580ebc339127273d2b29bb77cf201b72410b340140490ad54c3dea74aa0f3b5", "ja": "アタシの願い、それは……。\n大学の英語の単位を手に入れることだ！", "zh": "我的愿望是……\n拿到大学的英文学分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1051_012mam", "source_sha256": "e006321f58cce78d5b016df9080c0ac1da4fe1edea9a7977e37363834f4c2660", "ja": "あゆあゆ……。\n真美、よくわかんないけど……カッコ悪いよ？", "zh": "步步……\n真美虽然不太懂……但是感觉很逊耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1052_034ayu", "source_sha256": "ca510473c600a74e609e98a4b97b9059df5331dd4cd458b04f6acd813d7ab57b", "ja": "いいだろ別に！　アタシにとっては大切なことなんだ！\nこのままじゃ最悪、留年までありうるかも……！？", "zh": "有什么不好！这对我来说很重要耶！\n照现在这样下去，最惨的结局有可能就是留级……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1053_p", "source_sha256": "0fafc1afbe9420e8e55f536df63db717ba61bbca7e937992043a9c7047d83ba4", "ja": "学業に支障が出ないよう、スケジュールを組んできた\nつもりだったんだけど……ゴメンな、歩。", "zh": "我在安排工作行程时，已经尽量注意不要\n影响你的学业了，不过……抱歉啊，步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1054_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1f9f570e51354bb4df2de4e5afc8935176f80988e48bb298562dd718a0fc82d9", "ja": "いや、アタシが英語のテスト苦手過ぎるだけって\nいうか……。こっちこそ心配させてゴメン……。", "zh": "不，应该说是我自己太不擅长考英文……\n我才该说抱歉，让你担心了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1055_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f58085f0a54d1ba8d58ee64c7f215bc9494ff6d2a82cee953a986921e79e450c", "ja": "えっと、とにかく！\nお宝を手に入れるのは、アタシだー！", "zh": "呃，总而言之！\n得到宝物的人会是我──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1056_012mam", "source_sha256": "f7c6c0cd552deb2c4567963c4aaa3e1f3407fe497625aa3d3de201fcb4072ccf", "ja": "そうはいかないよ！\nお宝は、まみたま探検隊のものだー！", "zh": "才不会如你所愿！\n宝物是属于真美阿环探险队的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1057_040tam", "source_sha256": "490b74100dc18e2a6ea88ed2eb630a12e9de54696c846b004e17bcc680550058", "ja": "ものだ～！", "zh": "探险队的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1058_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7428f8e8b134689fc2baa3ae49b544554b9a7d373962cecd3871911b13da33ee", "ja": "お宝をゆずる気はないってことか。\nそれなら……アタシと勝負しろ！", "zh": "看来你们没有要让出宝物的打算吧。\n既然这样……就跟我一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1059_p", "source_sha256": "0bf28630354d07f994f9d420c33f91c33ac801be49c2fd281ceb44ee704daf1a", "ja": "勝負だって！？", "zh": "你说一决胜负！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1060_034ayu", "source_sha256": "503d6e2acdfc58864356f448fd573efe50d735c6db76b1d8d9d80965ea3a7a4e", "ja": "うん。ダンスバトルをして、\n負けた方はお宝をあきらめる……。どうだ？", "zh": "嗯，双方比赛跳舞，\n输的那一方就要放弃宝物……怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1061_040tam", "source_sha256": "f9db17fe3adda4a3e026920f430b263bee54f5083db8210bde246e88ad71fc3f", "ja": "おおっ、楽しそ～♪\nたまき、あゆむとダンス勝負したいぞ！", "zh": "哦哦，感觉很有趣～♪\n环想要跟步比舞喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1062_034ayu", "source_sha256": "01c8cf1b1e1396f3d62d466ff0959f29e584480312812dad9cd9935de2aa029e", "ja": "決まりだな！\nそれじゃあ、レッツダーンス！", "zh": "说好了喔！\n那么就Let's dance！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1063_p", "source_sha256": "b23f1b7b31c4d5ece29f058f8eb60ce1ad53535b02b6e06abc112efcb03145b7", "ja": "さすがに、ダンスのキレは圧倒的だな、歩。\n環も頑張っているんだが、分が悪いな……。", "zh": "不愧是步，跳起舞来俐落得无人能敌。\n环也很努力了，不过还是居于劣势……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1064_040tam", "source_sha256": "82fed8d804fbb2a11a4f6b8f1c7bcc43590852e9ea020fd7d099853e99589633", "ja": "あゆむ、強いぞ～……。\nけど、たまき、負けたくない！", "zh": "步你很强喔～\n不过，环也不想输！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1065_012mam", "source_sha256": "d75c35bb632ce9cb9a355ddb733a688aed2d6b20713aca4a363c4843fb2273aa", "ja": "頑張れ、たまきちー！　ここで負けちゃったら、\n真美の甘やかされまくりんぼライフが……。", "zh": "阿环加油～！要是在这里输了，\n真美饱受宠爱的彩色人生就要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1066_012mam", "source_sha256": "b01270d4803b5bee778b0dc543dfb5ca717224ac44a0cfa581a4fb52bec1c03d", "ja": "……そうだ！　いいこと思いついた！\nあゆあゆ、こっち見て！", "zh": "……对了！真美想到一个好主意！\n步步，看这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1067_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8f229fb065023072ab9098d52b2114c721008477f3ed145b4d1bf7c566e758ac", "ja": "うん、どうした真……み！？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，真……美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1068_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8e9efaa9469ee681139cf61fe6fe2c385481722c3c6931d8399299a2a72fa3bb", "ja": "ぷっ！　あはははっ！\n真美、なんだよその変顔～！　あははははは！", "zh": "噗！啊哈哈哈！\n真美，你那个表情是怎样～！啊哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1069_034ayu", "source_sha256": "20fd22ac8284aad65e9c5d822f9e2bafa5aea9c5a099644344ee0dc3b08a0a84", "ja": "だ、ダメだ……！\n笑いすぎて、踊れない……！　あっははははは！", "zh": "不、不行……！\n笑到跳不下去了……！啊哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1070_012mam", "source_sha256": "50ff4108aec33a3ad7b0478f9d7aed9ca8b3a957008c6782a9c3771de110dfde", "ja": "んっふっふ～。あゆあゆは踊れなくなったから、\nこの勝負、たまきちの勝ちだね！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～因为步步无法继续跳舞，\n这场比赛是阿环赢了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1071_040tam", "source_sha256": "c0eacfb0cbada2ed5897cadb080067f7c7bc419ea48278193010e09927d38197", "ja": "やったー！\nあゆむに勝ったぞ～！", "zh": "太好了──！\n环赢过步了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1072_034ayu", "source_sha256": "54ceba769d33a13e0e80e1885bca68ce422314c3a46554a5120864e33c357ae8", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな、アタシの単位が……！\nマイガーッ！？", "zh": "什么！？怎么这样，那我的学分不就……！\nMy God！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1073_p", "source_sha256": "45fade2b82b93527b1ef95aa1d35731431739b814eae4c4d9aecb5254c84d3a8", "ja": "しかたないな、歩。\nここは地道に勉強して、自力で単位を取ろう！", "zh": "没办法了，步。\n你还是脚踏实地好好念书，用自己的力量拿到学分吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1074_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0e601bcf2d9c0c0624f081c3b35ed3475a644f33cd6be13a8c8cad063da692ca", "ja": "うう、そうするしかないか……。", "zh": "呜呜，只能这样了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0060_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0060_story_02_1075_040tam", "source_sha256": "f61dc2cd7a8e051afd8d0c1dfaa845df472ffd6ac071e67125ff7dea3591e87a", "ja": "くふふ♪　それじゃあ、\nお宝をさがしに行こう、まみ、おやぶん！", "zh": "呵呵♪那就出发去找宝物吧，\n真美、老大！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
